{"_note":"speaker -> whole spoken line -> file. Built by tools/voices-gemini.mjs only.","lines":{"cole":{"A trapdoor. Chief, there's something under this airfield.":"cole/g_11d3752fcad0.m4a"},"hart":{"Inspector Hart. Come to Sable Flat. The truth about the Marigold. Tell no one. C. Pryce.":"hart/g_de4730b70da2.m4a"},"pryce":{"To Marigold. May she forgive me.":"pryce/g_54a47158fba0.m4a"},"vivienne":{"Inspector, darling. Come to watch the widow weep? I'm afraid I'm not very good at it.":"vivienne/g_1689128a4f74.m4a"},"billie":{"Get out of my face, Inspector.":"billie/g_7fc846cf80a8.m4a"},"lindqvist":{"Cyanide. Yes. I smelled it. God forgive me, I smelled it and I said heart failure because I was afraid of what an inquest would find. Not who killed him. What else.":"lindqvist/g_3607d4587c6b.m4a"},"julian":{"Business is business, Inspector. A signature is ink. Murder is something else.":"julian/g_c70ba161b8ae.m4a"},"ox":{"Don't come down, Inspector. Please. There's nothing down here.":"ox/g_4cb470eb5f8f.m4a"},"tamsin":{"Yes. Five hundred a month for the real weather report. Blackmail isn't murder, Inspector. Dead men don't pay.":"tamsin/g_d20d1a59dbb9.m4a"},"hobbs":{"Tapping in the wires. Months of it. Late at night, little messages, like someone learning. I thought it was the Marigold's ghost come home.":"hobbs/g_47785cc86a82.m4a"},"clementine":{"He knew the mount was cracked. He knew about the weather. He carried me out of the fire whispering 'don't tell them you were aboard'. Not because he was ashamed. Because I was proof.":"clementine/g_5bf950a86700.m4a"},"cylinder":{"Daddy, I can see the ridge!":"cylinder/g_312ffaef9b4a.m4a"}},"voices":{"cole":"designed: cole","hart":"designed: hart","pryce":"designed: pryce","vivienne":"designed: vivienne","billie":"designed: billie","lindqvist":"designed: lindqvist","julian":"designed: julian","ox":"designed: ox","tamsin":"designed: tamsin","hobbs":"designed: hobbs","clementine":"designed: clementine","cylinder":"designed: clementine"}}